        "original_id": "debbaf47-9549-51ef-96e2-3b915d8e7693",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 12th Lumières Awards, 2007 César Awards\n- People: Isabelle Mergault, Guillaume Canet, Philippe Lefebvre, François Cluzet\n- Works: Tell No One\n- Awards: Best Film, Best Director, Best Actor, Best Editing, Best Music Written for a Film\n\nFacts:\n- Isabelle Mergault chaired the 12th Lumières Awards ceremony.\n- Tell No One won the Best Film award at the 12th Lumières Awards.\n- Guillaume Canet and Philippe Lefebvre wrote Tell No One.\n- François Cluzet starred in Tell No One.\n- At the 2007 César Awards in France, Tell No One won four categories: Best Director for Guillaume Canet, Best Actor for François Cluzet, Best Editing, and Best Music Written for a Film.",
